      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.05 (down from ₹14.64 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.46b (down 3.9% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹73.7m (down 11% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.0% (down from 5.4% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
